The '''Scarif system''' was a [[star system]] within the [[Abrion sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. The system contained the [[planet]] [[Scarif]], an important world for the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition" />

